# Google reviews. Used ONLY by `npm run reviews:refresh`, which calls Google
# once and writes a committed snapshot. Not needed in your hosting env.
#
# 1. Google Cloud console -> enable "Places API (New)" and enable billing
# 2. Create an API key, restrict it to Places API (New)
# 3. Find the Place ID for the business:
#    https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/place-id
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=
